Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:24.96,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,450)\pos(1655,1027)}烏露露TV
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:14.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\pos(1126,207)}這邊我會看好 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:14.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(358,501)}愛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:14.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\pos(418,662)}謝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:14.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\pos(418,863)}照看好她倆哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:14.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(1412,930)}謹此拜託
